# dsk-video-counter.pdl - presentation video, part 7 (2026-11-09): COUNTER, then AMEND, then CANCEL, in the real editor, on a game that is STOPPED (tests/dsk-stop.pdl) with p2 current in PRE and an open offer p2 -> p1 made by the engine CLI (a pet cannot propose yet):
#   deskopoly.+x <app dir> <game dir> offer p1 give cash:20 get prop:<n> as=p2 ; deskopoly.+x ... ui ; deskopoly_ctl tr_close <games dir>   (<n> = a tile p1 owns: in the recorded game p1 bought Golden Row, prop:26, in round 4)
# The popup then reads "p2 OFFERS" with Accept offer / Reject offer / Counter...; Counter opens the trade panes with the SWAPPED terms, ask 10 more, Send counter; the counter is now MY open offer (YOUR OFFER); Amend offer... prefills my terms, ask 10 less, Send amendment;
# Cancel offer ends it. Pictures 40 to 45 go to /tmp/claude-1000/vid/raw. See also dsk-seat-counter.pdl and dsk-seat-amend.pdl (the one-at-a-time forms with their shots in @.apps/deskopoly/shots).
# Run: RELAY_DRIVE_NO_ESC=1 relay_drive <editor window pid> run @.apps/deskopoly/tests/dsk-video-counter.pdl <x window id>
STEP | see | label:p2 OFFERS
STEP | see | label:Accept offer
STEP | see | label:Counter...
STEP | see | label:Trade... | absent
STEP | shot | /tmp/claude-1000/vid/raw/40-offer-to-me.png
STEP | press | label:Counter...
STEP | see | label:COUNTER to p2
STEP | see | label:Golden Row (press: back)
STEP | see | label:ask $20
STEP | sleep | 800
STEP | shot | /tmp/claude-1000/vid/raw/41-counter-swapped.png
STEP | press | label:ask 10 more
STEP | see | label:ask $30
STEP | press | label:Send counter
STEP | expect | @.apps/rpg-edit-hq/state/games/deskopoly/game/ledger.txt | contains | give=prop:26;get=cash:30 | 10
STEP | see | label:YOUR OFFER
STEP | see | label:Amend offer...
STEP | sleep | 800
STEP | shot | /tmp/claude-1000/vid/raw/42-counter-sent.png
STEP | press | label:Amend offer...
STEP | see | label:AMEND your offer
STEP | see | label:Send amendment
STEP | see | label:ask $30
STEP | press | label:ask 10 less
STEP | see | label:ask $20
STEP | sleep | 800
STEP | shot | /tmp/claude-1000/vid/raw/43-amend-changed.png
STEP | press | label:Send amendment
STEP | expect | @.apps/rpg-edit-hq/state/games/deskopoly/game/ledger.txt | contains | amended | 10
STEP | see | label:YOUR OFFER
STEP | sleep | 800
STEP | shot | /tmp/claude-1000/vid/raw/44-amended.png
STEP | press | label:Cancel offer
STEP | expect | @.apps/rpg-edit-hq/state/games/deskopoly/game/ledger.txt | contains | cancelled | 10
STEP | see | label:YOUR OFFER | absent
STEP | sleep | 800
STEP | shot | /tmp/claude-1000/vid/raw/45-cancelled.png
